            "blockType": "Video"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "The beauty of this style of sweater is the ability to make it your own! There are many options for finishing the hem, neckbands and cuffs.  For our sample, we used the simplest, rolled edges, but you can mix and match to your heart's content!<br>If you are adventurous, you can find many more options in the Knit it Now Learning LIbrary.<br>Let's look at few basic options.",
