      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "This 28 page downloadable pattern includes a sample pattern for you to knit.\r\n<br>\r\nIt is written in 2 gauges (standard and bulky).  Since this is a sample sweater, there is no need to match the gauge.\r\n<br><blockquote class=\"smallblock\"><em><b>NOTE:</b> The purpose of this exercise is to get you familiar with the construction techniques of this top down sweater, without a huge time investment. </em></blockquote>\r\n<br>\r\nThese written instructions, along with the start-to-finish videos are designed to ensure your success in knitting this sweater.",
              "legacyComponentId": 488,
              "order": 1
            },
